hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23879","Jarir narrated to us from Ata ibn al-Sa'ib from Harb ibn Hilal al-Thaqafi from the father of his mother, a man of Taghlib, that he heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saying: There are no tithes upon the Muslims, tithes are only upon the Jews and Christians."
